Check current authoring, recorded relationships and applicable local content

Usage: empack check [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --documents              Validate author files and any present lock, without reading content
                               or providers
      --online                 Also check fresh provider metadata for every exact locked provider
                               selection
      --details                Include successful checks and all unverified evidence
      --state-dir <STATE_DIR>  Durable operation and recovery storage, separate from disposable
                               caches [env: EMPACK_STATE_DIR=]
      --cache-dir <CACHE_DIR>  Disposable cache root; previews only inspect existing objects [env:
                               EMPACK_CACHE_DIR=]
      --json                   Emit a structured report, including useful findings before a failed
                               check
      --quiet                  Hide temporary progress
  -y, --yes                    Run without prompts; unresolved content choices still fail [env:
                               EMPACK_YES=]
      --dry-run                Preview changes without publishing project, instance or durable state
                               [env: EMPACK_DRY_RUN=]
  -h, --help                   Print help
  -V, --version                Print version
